<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#isSatisfiedBy> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#commitsToStructuralStance> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SatisfactionByStatesOfAffairs> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#isSatisfiedBy> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#commitsToStructuralStance> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SatisfactionByStatesOfAffairs> .
_:genid1 <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#commitmentEvidence> "isSatisfiedBy rdfs:range StateOfAffairs (this module, Section 10)." .
_:genid1 <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#commitmentNote> "Declared by OntoDesire itself: even object-desires are given state-of-affairs satisfiers -- structurally adjacent to the possession-rewrite the audit flags in SUMO, retained here because satisfaction conditions, unlike contents, are standardly worldly; object-desire theorists may contest it." .
