<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#strongerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Desire> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#strongerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "stronger than"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#strongerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "D1 is stronger than D2 iff the agent is disposed to act on D1 when: all else is equal, each desire is believed satisfiable by a distinct action, and they are believed not jointly satisfiable."@en .
