# https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireStrength
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireStrength> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireStrength> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "desire strength"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireStrength> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A continuous magnitude, canonically characterized by causal power over the control of action; each theory of desire induces its own corresponding metric."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireStrength> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Puzzle: manifestations of strength fluctuate (mood, fatigue, temporal distance) without the strength itself seeming to vary — an advantage of holistic and learning-based theories, which do not reduce strength to a single observable."@en .
