<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AnimalObjection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "non-human animal objection"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AnimalObjection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rats seem to desire without representing anything as good; if desire does not require representing the good in them, why in us?"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AprioriImplausibilityObjection
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AprioriImplausibilityObjection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
