<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AprioriImplausibilityObjection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a priori implausibility objection"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AprioriImplausibilityObjection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The theory admits desire in a creature incapable of acting or feeling, provided it represents and learns appropriately."@en .
