<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireAsPerceptionOfGood> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#suffersObjection> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AnimalObjection> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireAsPerceptionOfGood> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "desire as perception of the good"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DesireAsPerceptionOfGood> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "To desire p is for p to appear good to the organism — a high-level perceptual state, distinct from judgment."@en .
