# https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DirectedAttention
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DirectedAttention> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DirectedAttention> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MonofactorialTheory> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DirectedAttention> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#belongsToFamily> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#AttentionBasedFamily> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DirectedAttention> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#defendedBy> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#TMScanlon> .
