<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DoubleFaultObjection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "double fault objection (Stampe)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DoubleFaultObjection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Believing that serving just so will cause a double fault can dispose one to serve just so, without one desiring to double fault."@en .
