<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#HedonicDispositional> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hedonic dispositional theory"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#HedonicDispositional> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "To desire p is to be disposed to take pleasure in its seeming that p and displeasure in its seeming that not-p."@en .
