<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#HedonicNeural> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hedonic neural-identity theory"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#HedonicNeural> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Pleasure episodes are identical to reward-system activity, and that activity does the work of desire; so desires are pleasure episodes."@en .
