# https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MotivatingGoodBeliefObjection
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MotivatingGoodBeliefObjection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MotivatingGoodBeliefObjection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Objection> .
