# https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MonofactorialTheory> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#belongsToFamily> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#ActionBasedFamily> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#defendedBy> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MichaelSmith> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#identifiesDesireWith> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#ActionDisposition> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#impliesCategory> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DispositionCategory> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#suffersObjection> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#DoubleFaultObjection> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#suffersObjection> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MotivatingGoodBeliefObjection> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#suffersObjection> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#UnactionableDesiresObjection> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sophisticated action-dispositional theory"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#SophisticatedActionDispositional> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "To desire p is to be disposed to take whatever actions one believes are likely to bring about p."@en .
