<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Teleofunctional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#identifiesDesireWith> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#ActionProductionFunction> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Teleofunctional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#impliesCategory> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#BiologicalFunctionCategory> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Teleofunctional> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#suffersObjection> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#MotivatingGoodBeliefObjection> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Teleofunctional> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "teleofunctional action theory"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Teleofunctional> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Desires are states whose function is to produce actions, whether or not they actually dispose the agent."@en .
