<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#norasDesireForTea> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#hasContent> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#noraDrinksTeaSoon> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#norasDesireForTea> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#hasStrength> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#norasTeaDesireStrength> .
<https://w3id.org/ontodesire#norasDesireForTea> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#isSatisfiedBy> <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#noraDrinksTeaSoon> .
